# GOLIVE.2a — keep the Docker build context lean + NEVER ship secrets or local state.
# The Dockerfiles COPY the repo root then `turbo prune`; everything here is excluded
# from that context (reinstalled/rebuilt in-image, or must never enter an image).

# reinstalled inside the image
**/node_modules
# rebuilt inside the image
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo

# secrets + local env — NEVER in an image (Railway injects env at runtime)
.env
.env.*
!.env.production.example

# vcs + local tooling
.git
.gitignore
.husky

# local dev infra (Railway provides Postgres/Redis; R2 is the prod blob store)
docker
docker-compose.yml

# large / irrelevant to the build
design
exports
research
playbooks
prospects
**/uploads
**/screenshots
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
coverage
